, missing headers, rate limiting, and input validation. Use when reviewing server code before deployment or after changes.","filePath":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/nodejs-security-audit/SKILL.md","baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/nodejs-security-audit","source":"openclaw-workspace","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/nodejs-security-audit","origin":"top-level","path":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/nodejs-security-audit/SKILL.md","scope":"project","source":"openclaw-workspace"},"disableModelInvocation":false,"available":true},{"id":"ontology","name":"ontology","description":"Typed knowledge graph for structured agent memory and composable skills. Use when creating/querying entities (Person, Project, Task, Event, Document), linking related objects, enforcing constraints, planning multi-step actions as graph transformations, or when skills need to share state. Trigger on \"remember\", \"what do I know about\", \"link X to Y\", \"show dependencies\", entity CRUD, or cross-skill data access.","filePath":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/ontology/SKILL.md","baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/ontology","source":"openclaw-managed","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/ontology","origin":"top-level","path":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/ontology/SKILL.md","scope":"project","source":"openclaw-managed"},"disableModelInvocation":false,"available":true},{"id":"openclaw-free-models","name":"openclaw-free-models","description":"OpenClaw 免费模型配置 - 教你用免费的 AI 模型。适合：预算有限用户、学生、测试者。","filePath":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/openclaw-free-models/SKILL.md","baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/openclaw-free-models","source":"openclaw-managed","sourceInfo":{"baseDir":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/openclaw-free-models","origin":"top-level","path":"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/skills/openclaw-free-models/SKILL.md","scope":"project","source":"openclaw-managed"},"disableModelInvocation":false,"available":true},{"id":"proactive-agent","name":"pro